-- הסכם קיבוצי (שכר) לעניין תנאי העסקה של עובדי הוראה ברפורמת "אופק חדש"
-- (19.10.2022) — העותק החתום עם הנספחים: a second copy of the wage agreement
-- of 19.10.2022, the signed one, which the corpus publishes beside the
-- primary (`2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement`). Its words are the
-- primary's, row for row and key for key: it differs only in spacing, the
-- kind of dash, a few dates written in by hand (the same dates), a doubled
-- word the primary prints in the first party's line, and one "עובד" for
-- "עובדי" in a recital. So this file imports the primary's encoding and
-- cites it for every prose row.
--
-- What is new here is the annexes the primary names and does not hold:
-- twenty-three tables the corpus publishes after the signatures, each
-- written below cell for cell — the combined-salary tables א1–א9, the
-- Ofek 2022 supplement of 1.9.2022 (ב1–ב7) and of 1.9.2023 (ג1–ג7). Annex
-- ה is not in this copy: the follow-up committee's decision of 2.11.2022
-- says it was left out by oversight and attaches it (its own module).
-- The corpus prints no annex label on any table; each is named here by its
-- place, which the primary's ranges and the follow-up committee's decision
-- of 14.1.2025 fix (its §3 names א1, א2, ב1, ב2, ג1 and ג2 as the BA and MA
-- tables, its §5 names ג3 as the 1.9.2023 supplement for BA teachers on the
-- conversion table): the annexes run in threes — a combined-salary table,
-- its Ofek supplement of 1.9.2022 and of 1.9.2023 — for the BA and MA
-- tables, then the conversion tables of BA, MA, בכיר (104), מוסמך (105)
-- and בלתי מוסמך (106) teachers; then the principals' tables of 1.9.2022
-- (א8) and of 1.9.2023 (א9), which §4.2 says replaces א8.
--
-- The tables' types are this file's own. The first part's (2011) `salary
-- table` holds one table under a rating code; these annexes hold up to
-- three tables each, the principals' with no rating code, and print the day
-- they apply from, which the rules below check. The rules that take an
-- annex — §4's table in force, §5's supplement, §6's new table salary — are
-- the primary's, imported, and are wired to the tables at the end.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement`

§ `הסכם השכר של אופק חדש — 19.10.2022 (העותק החתום והנספחים)`

