§§ `הנספחים — טבלאות השכר המשולב ותוספת אופק 2022`

-- A table is its title, its rating code where it prints one, the grades
-- its header row prints (the principals' letters numbered as the base
-- agreement numbers them: א 1, א+ 1.5, ב 2, ב+ 2.5, ג 3, ג+ 3.5, ד 4), the
-- steps its second row prints under the grades (7.5% under each whole
-- grade of a teachers' table), and its rows. A row is the seniority (a
-- teachers' table) or complexity level (a principals' table) printed at its
-- head, the step printed beside it (2% or 1% over the row above; none in
-- the first row or a principals' table), and its amounts from the first
-- grade on, as printed; a blank cell, printed only past a row's last
-- amount, is not in it. An Ofek 2022 table is one row of amounts by grade,
-- labelled 0. An annex is its label, the day it prints under it, and its
-- tables.
@desc One printed row of a table annexed to the wage agreement of 2022.
DECLARE `signed-copy annex row` HAS
    `signed-copy row label`   IS A NUMBER       @desc the seniority or complexity level the row prints at its head; 0 for the one row of an Ofek 2022 table
    `signed-copy row step`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc the rate printed beside the label over the row above
    `signed-copy row amounts` IS A LIST OF NUMBER

@desc One printed table of an annex to the wage agreement of 2022.
DECLARE `signed-copy annex grid` HAS
    `signed-copy grid title`       IS A STRING
    `signed-copy grid rating code` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc קוד דירוג, where the title prints one
    `signed-copy grid grades`      IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `signed-copy grid grade steps` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `signed-copy grid rows`        IS A LIST OF `signed-copy annex row`

@desc An annex of the wage agreement of 2022, as its signed copy prints it.
DECLARE `signed-copy annex` HAS
    `signed-copy annex label`       IS A STRING
    `signed-copy annex printed day` IS A DATE
    `signed-copy annex grids`       IS A LIST OF `signed-copy annex grid`

GIVEN label IS A NUMBER, step IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      amounts IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A `signed-copy annex row`
DECIDE `a signed-copy annex row` label step amounts IS
    `signed-copy annex row` WITH
        `signed-copy row label`   IS label
        `signed-copy row step`    IS step
        `signed-copy row amounts` IS amounts

GIVEN title IS A STRING, code IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      grades IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      steps IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      rs IS A LIST OF `signed-copy annex row`
GIVETH A `signed-copy annex grid`
DECIDE `a signed-copy annex grid` title code grades steps rs IS
    `signed-copy annex grid` WITH
        `signed-copy grid title`       IS title
        `signed-copy grid rating code` IS code
        `signed-copy grid grades`      IS grades
        `signed-copy grid grade steps` IS steps
        `signed-copy grid rows`        IS rs

GIVEN label IS A STRING, day IS A DATE
      gs IS A LIST OF `signed-copy annex grid`
GIVETH A `signed-copy annex`
DECIDE `a signed-copy annex` label day gs IS
    `signed-copy annex` WITH
        `signed-copy annex label`       IS label
        `signed-copy annex printed day` IS day
        `signed-copy annex grids`       IS gs

-- A row's amount under a grade: the amounts pair with the header's grades
-- from the first on.
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
      grades IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      amounts IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount printed under grade` grade grades amounts IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD fst p EQUALS grade) (zip grades amounts)
    WHEN p FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (snd p)
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING

-- A table's cell at a row's label and a grade.
GIVEN g IS A `signed-copy annex grid`, label IS A NUMBER, grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed-copy cell` g label grade IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `signed-copy row label` EQUALS label) (g's `signed-copy grid rows`)
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the amount printed under grade` grade (g's `signed-copy grid grades`) (r's `signed-copy row amounts`)
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING

-- An annex's table by its place among the annex's tables, from 1.
GIVEN i IS A NUMBER, a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A `signed-copy annex grid`
DECIDE `the table numbered` i `in` a IS
    at (a's `signed-copy annex grids`) (i MINUS 1)

-- א1: טבלת השכר למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/t1
`annex א1 of the signed copy` MEANS
    `a signed-copy annex` "א1" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `a signed-copy annex grid` "טבלת השכר למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)" (JUST 101)
                  (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9)
                  (LIST (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%))
                  (LIST `a signed-copy annex row` 1 NOTHING (LIST 6300),
