§§ `מה הנספחים מזינים בהסכם — §§4, 5 ו־6`

-- The combined-salary annexes in their order, א1–א9, and the Ofek 2022
-- annexes, ב1–ב7 and ג1–ג7: the n-th of each is the one the primary's
-- `annex א` n, `annexes ב1 to ב7` and `annexes ג1 to ג7` name.
`the signed copy's combined-salary annexes` MEANS
    LIST `annex א1 of the signed copy`, `annex א2 of the signed copy`, `annex א3 of the signed copy`,
         `annex א4 of the signed copy`, `annex א5 of the signed copy`, `annex א6 of the signed copy`,
         `annex א7 of the signed copy`, `annex א8 of the signed copy`, `annex א9 of the signed copy`

`the signed copy's annexes ב` MEANS
    LIST `annex ב1 of the signed copy`, `annex ב2 of the signed copy`, `annex ב3 of the signed copy`,
         `annex ב4 of the signed copy`, `annex ב5 of the signed copy`, `annex ב6 of the signed copy`,
         `annex ב7 of the signed copy`

`the signed copy's annexes ג` MEANS
    LIST `annex ג1 of the signed copy`, `annex ג2 of the signed copy`, `annex ג3 of the signed copy`,
         `annex ג4 of the signed copy`, `annex ג5 of the signed copy`, `annex ג6 of the signed copy`,
         `annex ג7 of the signed copy`

#ASSERT map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `signed-copy annex label`) `the signed copy's combined-salary annexes` EQUALS LIST "א1", "א2", "א3", "א4", "א5", "א6", "א7", "א8", "א9"
#ASSERT map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `signed-copy annex label`) `the signed copy's annexes ג` EQUALS LIST "ג1", "ג2", "ג3", "ג4", "ג5", "ג6", "ג7"

-- §4 (the primary's `the combined-salary table in force`): the table
-- salary on a day, for the table number n that §4.1 replaces, at the
-- annex's i-th table, a row's label and a grade. Before 1.9.2022 the table
-- in force on the eve of the signing governs, which the corpus does not
-- hold here: NOTHING.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE, i IS A NUMBER, label IS A NUMBER, grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the table salary under §4 on` n d i label grade IS
    CONSIDER `the combined-salary table in force` n d
    WHEN `annex א` k THEN `the signed-copy cell` (`the table numbered` i `in` (at `the signed copy's combined-salary annexes` (k MINUS 1))) label grade
    WHEN `the table in force on the eve of the signing` THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT `the table salary under §4 on` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 3 1 EQUALS JUST 6555
#ASSERT `the table salary under §4 on` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2022) 1 3 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- An academic principal of a level-3 school at grade ב: א8 from 1.9.2022,
-- א9 in its place from 1.9.2023 (§4.2).
#ASSERT `the table salary under §4 on` 8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 2 3 2 EQUALS JUST 19643.48
#ASSERT `the table salary under §4 on` 8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023) 2 3 2 EQUALS JUST 20636.68

-- §5 (the primary's `the Ofek 2022 annexes in force` and `the Ofek 2022
-- supplement`): the supplement on a day for the table number n (1–7, the
-- order above), a grade and a share of a position.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE, grade IS A NUMBER, `position share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` n d grade `position share` IS
    CONSIDER `the Ofek 2022 annexes in force` d
    WHEN `annexes ב1 to ב7` THEN `the supplement from` (at `the signed copy's annexes ב` (n MINUS 1))
    WHEN `annexes ג1 to ג7` THEN `the supplement from` (at `the signed copy's annexes ג` (n MINUS 1))
    WHEN `no Ofek 2022 supplement` THEN JUST 0
    WHERE
        GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
        GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
        DECIDE `the supplement from` a IS
            CONSIDER `the signed-copy cell` (`the table numbered` 1 `in` a) 0 grade
            WHEN JUST amount THEN JUST (`the Ofek 2022 supplement` amount `position share`)
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 0.5 EQUALS JUST 396.5
#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 3 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023) 1.5 1 EQUALS JUST 1460.54
#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2022) 1 1 EQUALS JUST 0

-- §6 (the primary's `the updated personal supplement rate`): B is the new
-- table salary by grade and complexity level, from א8 and then א9. The
-- rate C = A / B keeps the shekel amount A: an academic principal of a
-- level-3 school at grade ב with the example's 2,499.6.
`B for a level-3 principal at grade ב from 1.9.2022` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the table salary under §4 on` 8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 2 3 2
    WHEN JUST b THEN b
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

#ASSERT `the updated personal supplement rate` 2499.6 `B for a level-3 principal at grade ב from 1.9.2022` TIMES `B for a level-3 principal at grade ב from 1.9.2022` EQUALS 2499.6

-- §13.1.3 names annex ה, which this copy does not hold: the decision of
-- 2.11.2022 attaches it (`2022-11-02_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakav_corrections-and-annex-he`).

§§ `הימים שהנספחים מדפיסים`

-- Every annex prints under it the day it is updated from: א1–א8 and ב1–ב7
-- 1.9.2022, א9 and ג1–ג7 1.9.2023 — save ג3, which prints 1.1.2023.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1/p3 akn:att_6__hc_1/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1/p2 akn:att_8__hc_1/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1/p2 akn:att_10__hc_1/p3 akn:att_11__hc_1/p2 akn:att_12__hc_1/p2 akn:att_13__hc_1/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1/p2 akn:att_15__hc_1/p2 akn:att_16__hc_1/p2 akn:att_17__hc_1/p2 akn:att_18__hc_1/p2 akn:att_19__hc_1/p2 akn:att_20__hc_1/p2 akn:att_21__hc_1/p2 akn:att_22__hc_1/p4 akn:att_23__hc_1/p4
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day the annex prints` a IS
    a's `signed-copy annex printed day`

-- The day §§4–5 apply each annex from: §4.1 א1–א8 and §5.1 ב1–ב7 from
-- 1.9.2022; §4.2 א9 and §5.2 ג1–ג7 from 1.9.2023.
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` a IS
    IF elem a `the signed copy's annexes ג` OR a's `signed-copy annex label` EQUALS "א9"
    THEN `1 September 2023`
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022

`the signed copy's annexes` MEANS
    concat (LIST `the signed copy's combined-salary annexes`, `the signed copy's annexes ב`, `the signed copy's annexes ג`)

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-signed-a: annex ג3 prints "updated from 1.1.2023";
-- §5.2 applies ג1–ג7 from 1.9.2023, and every other ג annex prints that
-- day. §5.2's day is read (convention reading.misprint), as the follow-up
-- committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§5) later says it is.
`the annexes that print a day other than the one §§4–5 apply them from` MEANS
    map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `signed-copy annex label`)
        (filter (GIVEN a YIELD NOT (`the day the annex prints` a EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` a)) `the signed copy's annexes`)

`annex ג3 prints 1.1.2023 where §5.2 applies it from 1.9.2023` MEANS
        `the annexes that print a day other than the one §§4–5 apply them from` EQUALS LIST "ג3"
    AND `the day the annex prints` `annex ג3 of the signed copy` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2023
#ASSERT `annex ג3 prints 1.1.2023 where §5.2 applies it from 1.9.2023`

§§ `בדיקות הטבלאות`

-- Checks over every cell of the annexes, of what the tables are to one
-- another. A comparison forgives the rounding the printed figures carry: an
-- agora between tables printed to the agora, half a shekel between a table
-- printed to the shekel and one printed to the agora.
GIVEN m IS A MAYBE NUMBER, tolerance IS A NUMBER, x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the cell` m `is within` tolerance `of` x IF
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST y THEN y MINUS x AT MOST tolerance AND x MINUS y AT MOST tolerance
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- Every cell of one table, set beside the same row and grade of another,
-- at a factor (1 where the two should be the same).
GIVEN other IS A `signed-copy annex grid`, factor IS A NUMBER, tolerance IS A NUMBER
      grades IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      r IS A `signed-copy annex row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the row agrees with the other table` other factor tolerance grades r IF
    all (GIVEN p YIELD `the cell` (`the signed-copy cell` other (r's `signed-copy row label`) (fst p)) `is within` tolerance `of` (snd p TIMES factor)) (zip grades (r's `signed-copy row amounts`))

GIVEN g IS A `signed-copy annex grid`, other IS A `signed-copy annex grid`, factor IS A NUMBER, tolerance IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every cell of` g `agrees with` other `at` factor `within` tolerance IF
    all (GIVEN r YIELD `the row agrees with the other table` other factor tolerance (g's `signed-copy grid grades`) r) (g's `signed-copy grid rows`)

GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A `signed-copy annex grid`
DECIDE `the first table of` a IS
    `the table numbered` 1 `in` a

-- 1. The BA and MA tables (א1, א2), printed to the shekel, are the whole
-- grades of the conversion tables of the same degree (א3, א4), printed to
-- the agora, within half a shekel; and the Ofek supplements the same (ב1,
-- ב2 against ב3, ב4; ג1, ג2 against ג3, ג4).
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-signed-b: so the agreement gives two salaries for
-- one cell: a BA teacher at grade 1 and seniority 3 is paid 6,555 by א1 and
-- 6,554.52 by א3 (and so through both tables, and MA). The agora tables are
-- read (convention precedence.specific: the table printed to the agora
-- states the amount the shekel one rounds), as the follow-up committee's
-- decision of 14.1.2025 (§3) later puts agora tables in place of א1–א2,
-- ב1–ב2 and ג1–ג2.
`annex א1 and annex א3 print different salaries for the same grade and seniority` MEANS
        `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the signed copy`) 3 1 EQUALS JUST 6555
    AND `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) 3 1 EQUALS JUST 6554.52
#ASSERT `annex א1 and annex א3 print different salaries for the same grade and seniority`

-- 2. In each conversion table (א3–א7): an intermediate grade is the mean of
-- the grades either side of it; a whole grade is the grade before it and
-- the 7.5% step printed over it (within two agorot: each cell is rounded
-- from the one before it); a row is the row above it and the step printed
-- beside it.
GIVEN amounts IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every intermediate grade is the mean of its neighbours in` amounts IF
    all (GIVEN k YIELD `the cell` (JUST (at amounts (2 TIMES k PLUS 1))) `is within` 0.01 `of` ((at amounts (2 TIMES k) PLUS at amounts (2 TIMES k PLUS 2)) DIVIDED BY 2)) (range 0 7)

GIVEN steps IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      amounts IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every whole grade steps by the printed rate in` steps amounts IF
    all (GIVEN k YIELD `the cell` (JUST (at amounts (2 TIMES k PLUS 2))) `is within` 0.02 `of` (at amounts (2 TIMES k) TIMES (1 PLUS at steps k))) (range 0 7)

GIVEN above IS A `signed-copy annex row`, r IS A `signed-copy annex row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the row steps from the row above by its printed rate` above r IF
    CONSIDER r's `signed-copy row step`
    WHEN JUST s THEN all (GIVEN p YIELD `the cell` (JUST (snd p)) `is within` 0.01 `of` (fst p TIMES (1 PLUS s))) (zip (above's `signed-copy row amounts`) (r's `signed-copy row amounts`))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN g IS A `signed-copy annex grid`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the conversion table holds together` g IF
        all (GIVEN r YIELD `every intermediate grade is the mean of its neighbours in` (r's `signed-copy row amounts`)) (g's `signed-copy grid rows`)
    AND all (GIVEN r YIELD `every whole grade steps by the printed rate in` (g's `signed-copy grid grade steps`) (r's `signed-copy row amounts`)) (g's `signed-copy grid rows`)
    AND all (GIVEN p YIELD `the row steps from the row above by its printed rate` (fst p) (snd p)) (zip (g's `signed-copy grid rows`) (drop 1 (g's `signed-copy grid rows`)))

`the conversion tables` MEANS
    map `the first table of` (LIST `annex א3 of the signed copy`, `annex א4 of the signed copy`, `annex א5 of the signed copy`, `annex א6 of the signed copy`, `annex א7 of the signed copy`)

#ASSERT all `the conversion table holds together` `the conversion tables`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD count (g's `signed-copy grid rows`) EQUALS 36) `the conversion tables`

-- 3. The tables of existing teachers in grades בכיר, מוסמך and בלתי מוסמך
-- (א5–א7) are each the BA conversion table (א3) at one factor — the ratio
-- of their first cells — in every cell, within an agora; and their Ofek
-- supplements (ב5–ב7, ג5–ג7) are the BA conversion table's (ב3, ג3) at the
-- same factor.
GIVEN g IS A `signed-copy annex grid`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first amount of` g IS
    CONSIDER g's `signed-copy grid rows`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN at (r's `signed-copy row amounts`) 0
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0

GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the factor to the BA conversion table of` a IS
    `the first amount of` (`the first table of` a) DIVIDED BY `the first amount of` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`)

#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א5 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א5 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א6 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א6 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א7 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א7 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב5 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א5 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב6 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א6 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב7 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א7 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג5 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א5 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג6 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א6 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג7 of the signed copy`) `at` (`the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א7 of the signed copy`) `within` 0.01
#ASSERT `the factor to the BA conversion table of` `annex א5 of the signed copy` EQUALS 75%

-- 4. The Ofek supplement of 1.9.2023 is twice that of 1.9.2022, grade for
-- grade: within an agora in the tables printed to the agora (ב3–ב7 and
-- ג3–ג7), within a shekel in those printed to the shekel (ב1–ב2, ג1–ג2).
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`) `at` 2 `within` 1
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`) `at` 2 `within` 1
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD `every cell of` (`the first table of` (at `the signed copy's annexes ב` n)) `agrees with` (`the first table of` (at `the signed copy's annexes ג` n)) `at` 2 `within` 0.01) (range 2 6)

-- 5. The principals' annexes (א8, א9) print three tables each: academic
-- junior-high principals in a six-year school, academic principals, and
-- deputy principals (no level-1 row printed for deputies), by complexity
-- levels 1–8.
DECLARE `principals' table` IS ONE OF
    `academic junior-high principals in a six-year school`
    `academic principals`
    `deputy principals`
    `non-academic principals, first deputies or junior-high principals`

`the principals' tables annexes א8 and א9 print` MEANS
    LIST `academic junior-high principals in a six-year school`, `academic principals`, `deputy principals`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD count (a's `signed-copy annex grids`) EQUALS count `the principals' tables annexes א8 and א9 print`) (LIST `annex א8 of the signed copy`, `annex א9 of the signed copy`)
#ASSERT `the signed-copy cell` (`the table numbered` 3 `in` `annex א8 of the signed copy`) 1 1 EQUALS NOTHING

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-signed-c: §4 replaces every combined-salary table
-- in force with annexes א1–א9, and the principals' annexes print tables for
-- academic principals only: no table for a non-academic principal, first
-- deputy or six-year junior-high principal. Such a manager is read to stay
-- on the table in force on the eve of the signing until one is printed
-- (convention amounts.inputs: a table the text does not hold is a named
-- input); the follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§4) puts tables
-- for them in place of א8–א9.
`annexes א8 and א9 hold no table for a non-academic manager` MEANS
    NOT elem `non-academic principals, first deputies or junior-high principals` `the principals' tables annexes א8 and א9 print`
#ASSERT `annexes א8 and א9 hold no table for a non-academic manager`
